  <Annotation SID="13587">
    <P Name="Name">&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Helvetica&apos;; font-size:10px; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Group Description:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;1.Motor Command Generation: Converts generalized forces (N,Nm) from the stability controller into a set of normalized motor command percentages to be written as PWM inputs to the QDrone DAQ. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;2. QDrone DAQ:  Set of blocks used to configure the HIL target, which in this case is the QDrone. The write and read blocks are used to give you access to the instrumentation on the QDrone. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;3. Attitude Estimation: Data fusion of IMU Accelerometer and Gyroscope for BF attitude estimation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;4. QDrone DAQ Log: Black box for critical signals on QDrone. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</P>
    <P Name="Position">[402, -4, 915, 90]</P>
    <P Name="InternalMargins">[0, 0, 0, 0]</P>
    <P Name="FixedHeight">on</P>
    <P Name="FixedWidth">on</P>
    <P Name="HorizontalAlignment">left</P>
    <P Name="VerticalAlignment">top</P>
    <P Name="Interpreter">rich</P>
    <P Name="ZOrder">-1</P>
  </Annotation>
  <Annotation SID="13581">
    <P Name="Name">4. Plant Log</P>
    <P Name="Position">[-35, 474, 370, 599]</P>
