    <P Name="HorizontalAlignment">left</P>
    <P Name="VerticalAlignment">top</P>
    <P Name="ForegroundColor">[0.956863, 0.980392, 0.921569]</P>
    <P Name="BackgroundColor">[0.956863, 0.980392, 0.921569]</P>
    <P Name="DropShadow">on</P>
    <P Name="AnnotationType">area_annotation</P>
    <P Name="ZOrder">5819</P>
    <P Name="FontName">Arial</P>
    <P Name="FontSize">8</P>
  </Annotation>
  <Annotation SID="13549">
    <P Name="Name">&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Helvetica&apos;; font-size:10px; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9px;&quot;&gt;Motor commands are written to the QDrone via the HIL Write block. The motor command inputs are mapped for a Oneshot 125 protocol as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%; font-size:9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9px; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Percent	Seconds	Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9px;&quot;&gt;0%		125 us	No Throttle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9px;&quot;&gt;100%	250 us	Max Throttle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%; font-size:9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9px;&quot;&gt;The input to the motors are written as time period (in seconds) of the PWM pulses (at 2kHz).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%; font-size:9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9px;&quot;&gt;LED colors can be set using a simple 3x1 ON (1) and OFF (0) vector (RGB mode).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</P>
    <P Name="Position">[564, 133, 795, 270]</P>
    <P Name="InternalMargins">[0, 0, 0, 0]</P>
    <P Name="FixedHeight">on</P>
    <P Name="FixedWidth">on</P>
    <P Name="HorizontalAlignment">left</P>
    <P Name="VerticalAlignment">top</P>
    <P Name="Interpreter">rich</P>
    <P Name="ZOrder">-4</P>
  </Annotation>
  <Annotation SID="13550">
    <P Name="Name">&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Helvetica&apos;; font-size:10px; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;DAQ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</P>
    <P Name="Position">[440, 133, 471, 149]</P>
    <P Name="InternalMargins">[0, 0, 0, 0]</P>
    <P Name="HorizontalAlignment">left</P>
    <P Name="VerticalAlignment">top</P>
    <P Name="Interpreter">rich</P>
    <P Name="ZOrder">-5</P>
  </Annotation>
  <Annotation SID="13616">
    <P Name="Name">Angular Acceleration Estimation via Filter + Derivative</P>
    <P Name="Position">[840, 854, 1150, 974]</P>
    <P Name="InternalMargins">[0, 0, 0, 0]</P>
    <P Name="FixedHeight">on</P>
    <P Name="FixedWidth">on</P>
    <P Name="HorizontalAlignment">left</P>
    <P Name="VerticalAlignment">top</P>
    <P Name="ForegroundColor">[0.956863, 0.980392, 0.921569]</P>
    <P Name="BackgroundColor">[0.956863, 0.980392, 0.921569]</P>
    <P Name="DropShadow">on</P>
    <P Name="AnnotationType">area_annotation</P>
    <P Name="ZOrder">5825</P>
    <P Name="FontName">Arial</P>
  </Annotation>
  <Annotation SID="13618">
    <P Name="Name">The gyroscope readings are pre-calibrated and filtered. For hardware filtering settings, see the HIL Initialize block in DAQ. Gyroscope readings are very good estimates of the rotation rate of the system, and do not need further calibration/filtering. These readings are further differentiated to get angular acceleration estimates for use in the stabilization controllers.

The accelerometer readings in body reference frame are used to calculate a roll and pitch approximation. This is based on the knowledge that the gravity vector points straight down.</P>
    <P Name="Position">[483, 654, 758, 740]</P>
    <P Name="InternalMargins">[0, 0, 0, 0]</P>
    <P Name="FixedHeight">on</P>
    <P Name="FixedWidth">on</P>
    <P Name="HorizontalAlignment">left</P>
    <P Name="VerticalAlignment">top</P>
    <P Name="ZOrder">-3</P>
    <P Name="FontName">Arial</P>
    <P Name="FontSize">8</P>
  </Annotation>
  <Annotation SID="13619">
    <P Name="Name">Roll angle estimation via Complementary Filter </P>
