&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;where H is the last digits of your ground station&apos;s IP address (use ipconfig in a command prompt to find it out).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</P>
