  <Annotation SID="8140">
    <P Name="Name">&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Helvetica&apos;; font-size:10px; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;right&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:16px; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Quanser Autonomous Vehicles Research Studio&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Commander Stabilizer (Angle Mode) - QDrone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</P>
    <P Name="Position">[-640, 604, -260, 640]</P>
    <P Name="InternalMargins">[0, 0, 0, 0]</P>
    <P Name="FixedHeight">on</P>
    <P Name="FixedWidth">on</P>
    <P Name="HorizontalAlignment">left</P>
    <P Name="VerticalAlignment">top</P>
    <P Name="Interpreter">rich</P>
    <P Name="ZOrder">-28</P>
  </Annotation>
  <Annotation SID="8270">
    <P Name="Name">&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Helvetica&apos;; font-size:10px; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; font-size:1px;&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:12px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;Ensure that a connection to the drone is established by pinging to it. See the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Research Studio Setup &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;documentation (the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Communicating with the QDrone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; section). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:12px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;Open the Model Configuration Propeties under the Simulation menu.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-size:2px;&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:12px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;Under the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Code Generation &amp;gt; Interface &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;tab, enter the following MEX-file &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:7px;&quot;&gt;arguments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;              &apos;-w -d /tmp -uri %u -URI_Host tcpip://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;192.168.2.H&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;:18001&apos;, &apos;tcpip://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;QDrone0XXXXX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;.local&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;:17001?retries=10&apos;&lt;br /&gt;where &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;QDrone0XXXXX &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;can be found on the underside of the battery compartment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;192.168.2.H&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; is the IP address of the ground control station PC (should be 192.168.2.5 by default). &lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:12px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;Under the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;QUARC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; menu, click on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Build&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:12px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:1; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%; font-size:1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-size:1px;&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:12px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;Ensure that the associated &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Mission_Server&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; model is running. If not, this model will stop immediately upon running. Click on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Start&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; under the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;QUARC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; menu.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:12px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;Ensure that the drone behaves as expected (see the steps in the associated &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Mission_Server&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; model).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:12px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;This model will automatically stop when the QDrone lands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</P>
    <P Name="Position">[-1385, 578, -670, 665]</P>
    <P Name="InternalMargins">[0, 0, 0, 0]</P>
    <P Name="FixedHeight">on</P>
    <P Name="FixedWidth">on</P>
    <P Name="HorizontalAlignment">left</P>
    <P Name="VerticalAlignment">top</P>
    <P Name="Interpreter">rich</P>
    <P Name="ZOrder">-33</P>
  </Annotation>
</System>

